## Hints for Future Agents
WANDB_OPENAI_PROJECT and WANDB_QA_OPENAI_PROJECT are stored in Keychain under matching service names. Do not put their values into tracked files or notes. Environment variables take precedence over Keychain. Nested os.environ references in extra_headers work in this pinned LiteLLM version. These values are available at runtime to administrators and are sent upstream. The automatic post-commit push must be disabled when publication is not authorized.

## Codebase Discoveries
All three production models share a YAML header anchor; QA uses a separate project variable. The existing get_secret function works for project values as well as API keys. Recreating the container is required when adding environment variables.

